// WindShear section P1.02
// Game: WindShear
// Format: Valve
//
// This is the base of the section: the floor, the walls and the points
// the game reads. The textures are not here; they are made in Godot.
//
// The points are placed by hand. These are the names WindShear knows:
//
//   func_checkpoint_start   where the player starts
//   func_checkpoint_end     where the player finishes
//   func_split_marker       where the split timer is
//   func_gate               a regulation gate
//   func_hazard             a hazard volume
//   func_wind               a wind volume
//   func_filament           a filament anchor
//   func_parcel             a parcel
//   func_spawn              where something appears
//
// A brush says what shape it is by the material on it: floor, wall,
// platform or ramp. The entity a brush is in says the same thing:
// func_floor, func_wall, func_platform or func_ramp.
//
// One unit is one thirty-second of a metre.

